  "details": "Recently my Quest 2 controllers began to show noticeable drift which caused me to jolt quickly in a different direction when moving or slowly moving a direction after. Turning was even more a problem as I could snap back from a direction I turned from.\nWhile you can already set deadzones on the SteamVR version of the game, you cannot do it on the standalone Quest port, which is why I'm requesting this feature. If it eventually does get put in, I'd strongly recommend letting it be fully customizable.",
